 "一小格 0.04 s，一大格 0.20 s；心率 300 除以大格数。": "One small box 0.04 s, one large box 0.20 s; heart rate = 300 divided by number of large boxes.",
 "一度房室阻滞通常无症状，注意药物与电解质；二度 I 型多为房室结，若症状明显或进展可评估起搏；二度 II 型与三度阻滞若伴宽 QRS、晕厥或心力衰竭，起搏指征更强。": "First-degree AV block is usually asymptomatic; monitor drugs and electrolytes. Second-degree type I is mostly at the AV node; if symptoms are marked or it progresses, evaluate for pacing. Second-degree type II and third-degree block with wide QRS, syncope, or heart failure have stronger pacing indications.",
 "三度 AVB 伴长间歇/低血压。": "Third-degree AVB with long pauses/hypotension.",
 "三度房室阻滞：P 与 QRS 完全分离，心房率高于心室率，心室由交界区或室性逸搏起搏点驱动。QRS 窄提示交界性逸搏、病变相对较高；QRS 宽提示室性逸搏、病变位置更低，风险更高。": "Third-degree AV block: complete dissociation of P and QRS; atrial rate is higher than ventricular rate, and the ventricles are driven by a junctional or ventricular escape pacemaker. Narrow QRS suggests a junctional escape and a relatively higher lesion; wide QRS suggests a ventricular escape, a lower lesion, and higher risk.",
 "下壁 STEMI 忽略右室梗死，过量使用硝酸酯导致低血压。": "In inferior STEMI, missing right ventricular infarction and excessive nitrates cause hypotension.",
 "下壁导联 J 波 + 高振幅提示高危。": "J waves in inferior leads + high amplitude indicate high risk.",
 "不同病因改变的是不同向量成分：RVH 增加向右前向量，后壁 MI 丢失向后向量，WPW 改变初始除极。": "Different etiologies alter different vector components: RVH increases the rightward anterior vector, posterior MI loses the posterior vector, and WPW changes initial depolarization.",
 "不找诱因：再灌注、洋地黄、高钾、心肌炎都可能表现为 AIVR。": "Not identifying triggers: reperfusion, digitalis, hyperkalemia, and myocarditis can all present as AIVR.",
 "不等于三度 AVB。": "Does not equal third-degree AVB.",
